- Display & body: a monospaced workhorse — IBM Plex Mono, JetBrains Mono, or Berkeley Mono. Bloomberg itself uses a proprietary mono.
- Sizes: 11 / 12 / 13 / 14px — densely packed. No 16px body. No 32px headlines.
